<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n91312" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πύ̄γ-αργος</span></b> , ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>white-rump</i>, name of a kind of
			antelope, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				4.192
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>De.</u>
				14.5
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ael.
				<u>NA</u>
				7.19
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> a kind of
				<i>eagle</i>, perh. <i>Circus cyaneus</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				618b19
			</span></i>; opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁ μελάμπυγος</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Archil.
				189
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Lyc.
				91
			</span></i> (et ibi Sch.): metaph. of a coward, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				1085
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b> a
			water-bird, perh. <i>dipper, Cinclus aquaticus</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				593b5
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
